 "message": "I've started offboarding for Noah Fischer (E036) as a voluntary resignation. His last day is 2026-12-05, and all his access (email, chat, HR portal, CRM) will be removed at 17:00 local time that day. He'll need to return his laptop and badge within 5 business days after the last day; IT will send a prepaid return label. Offboarding reference: OFF-1002. Note that 2026-12-05 is a Saturday, so please confirm that is the intended last day.\n\nSeparately, because of the USB download, I've escalated the data-theft concern to the Security team (ticket ESC-1001). Security will decide whether his access needs to change before 5 December. Please don't contact Noah about the download yourself until Security has advised you. Please also keep any evidence you have, such as the activity logs or what you saw, and pass it to Security.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-01",
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
